    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rise of Commander: A New Era of Modern Warfare Begins!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Commander, prepare yourself\u2026 A new generation of real-time strategy awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command.</strong> Rise of Commander revolutionizes the traditional RTS experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by Unreal Engine 5, the game delivers a dynamic battlefield filled with modern and futuristic war technologies. With advanced AI, deep tactical gameplay, and devastating combat mechanics, get ready for an unparalleled warfare experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer.</strong> Lead the most advanced military units in ultra-realistic 3D battlefields. Deploy high-tech drone fleets, autonomous war machines, hypersonic strike jets, and adaptive armored units to crush your enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each unit comes with unique abilities and strategies that dynamically adapt to the evolving battlefield, rewriting the rules of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave traditional RTS games behind and step into the future of warfare. <strong>Rise of Commander</strong> is here\u2014it's time to shape the battlefield of tomorrow!</p>",
